      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandusky%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1835, the Mad River and Lake Erie Railroad began operations, turning Sandusky into a key rail hub for lake traffic.",
